1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,600
Tomorrow's lunch, sorted tonight.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,383
I ask the family, order what's missing and tell your cook in her language.

3
00:00:05,783 --> 00:00:07,280
Who's in the family? Tap everyone at home.

4
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:14,816
Each tap: how many people, how many roti and how much sabzi a day.

5
00:00:15,216 --> 00:00:24,650
Make your face. The family sees it on every vote.

6
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,539
Who decides, day by day? That's the baari: a turn that goes round the house.

7
00:00:26,589 --> 00:00:32,370
One person picks, or everyone votes.

8
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:34,329
Who goes first? Spin the coin.

9
00:00:37,529 --> 00:00:40,951
First baari decided. Tomorrow it moves on by itself.

10
00:00:41,351 --> 00:00:42,850
What goes on each plate? Tap, don't type. I'll never break these.

11
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:52,033
Papa's plate: one tap is less, two taps is never. Less spice, no oil.

12
00:00:52,083 --> 00:00:55,420
Fasts the house keeps: Navratri, Ekadashi.

13
00:00:55,470 --> 00:01:01,981
Or just say it: "Mummy ko meetha kam" (less sugar for Mummy).

14
00:01:02,381 --> 00:01:05,597
Who cooks? Sunita comes at 7:30 and understands Hindi best.

15
00:01:05,647 --> 00:01:10,734
The same note in Marathi

16
00:01:10,784 --> 00:01:13,434
This is how it sounds to her: a voice note at 7:45 am, nothing to read.

17
00:01:13,484 --> 00:01:17,934
"Didi, namaste. Tomorrow's lunch is rajma chawal, for four."

18
00:01:17,984 --> 00:01:22,484
"Rajma and tomatoes reach the door in the morning. No potato on one plate."

19
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:33,310
in Bangla

20
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:37,327
in Tamil

21
00:01:37,377 --> 00:01:41,316
in Kannada

22
00:01:41,366 --> 00:01:46,914
and in Telugu. Six languages, real Gnani voices.

23
00:01:47,214 --> 00:01:51,364
Let me run tonight once, so you can see: two dishes go out at 8:30 pm, a pick, rajma ordered for ₹106

24
00:01:51,414 --> 00:01:56,462
the parcel at the door by 6:40, a voice note to Sunita at 7:45, lunch on the stove.

25
00:01:56,562 --> 00:02:01,196
Your home is ready. Tonight at 8:30, it's real.
